    {
      "name": "Batch Processor",
      "implementation": "Internal to RecordBuilders.cs / AirTableConnectClient.cs, no new canvas components: (1) CreateRecordsComponent and UpdateRecordsComponent auto-chunk their incoming Record JSON list into groups of 10 (Airtable's per-call cap) and issue multiple sequential requests, concatenating Record IDs/Status/Response across chunks; (2) ListRecordsComponent auto-loops the `offset` pagination token internally until either the API returns no offset or Max Records is reached, rather than truncating at one page of up to 100."
    }
